{
  "about": "Which blob hashes a state references. api/media.js referencedHashes() and frontend/src/lib/media-refs.js referencedHashes() must both give `expect` (compared as sorted lists) for every `state` here: the server keeps and the client keeps exactly this set. Each of customEx[].media.hash, customEx[].media.poster.hash and the same two of every entry of workouts[].media counts on its own when it matches /^[0-9a-f]{64}$/ — deliberately looser than normalizeMediaRef, because this set decides what is kept.",
